<v Brian Reed>It's 3:30 in the afternoon on a Thursday. And Damien's greeting his boys, Damian Jr. and Leonte, as they get off the school bus. He asked them about their day, explains who these weird radio reporters are in their apartment. And then, they get to homework.
<v Brian Reed>这是周四下午3:30。达米恩正在迎接他的孩子们，小达米恩和莱昂特，因为他们下校车了。他问他们一天过得怎么样，解释这些奇怪的广播记者在他们的公寓里是谁。然后，他们开始做作业。

