<v Damien Lacks>Yeah, that's a big difference. OK, so just remember that tomorrow.
<v Damien Lacks>是的，那有很大的不同。好的，所以明天记得这一点。

00:35:57.560 --> 00:36:12.130
<v Bianca Giaever>Both Damien and Candice say without hesitation that if Damien never makes a dime from WakeUpNow, it still will have been the best move he could have made for their family.
<v Bianca Giaever>达米恩和坎迪斯都毫不犹豫地说，如果达米恩永远没有从“唤醒现在”赚到一分钱，这仍然会是他能为家庭做出的最好举动。

