00:42:31.380 --> 00:42:44.320
<v David Kestenbaum>And on some of these calls, there are only two people phoning in with questions, two people who feel the CEO is grossly overpaid, Andrew and Tim. They get to ask the CEO whatever they want. Here's one exchange.
