<v David Kestenbaum>Q2 means second quarter.
<v David Kestenbaum>Q2代表第二季度。

00:43:40.810 --> 00:43:42.570
<v Richard Horowitz>We're talking about the results of Q2.
<v Richard Horowitz>我们正在讨论第二季度的结果。

00:43:42.570 --> 00:43:42.890
<v Tim Stabosz>Well--
<v Tim Stabosz>嗯——

00:43:42.890 --> 00:43:50.810
<v Richard Horowitz>So please, please, please, Tim, and Andrew and anybody else, please, let's keep the comments to the Q2 numbers. Thank you.
