<v Richard Horowitz>我不能再评论了，蒂姆。还有关于第二季度的其他问题吗？

00:43:59.370 --> 00:44:06.880
<v Tim Stabosz>Well, it would have been helpful if you would have simply said, we're not going to talk about executive compensation, period. Because that's what you're essentially saying, right?
<v Tim Stabosz>嗯，如果你简单地说，我们不会谈论高管薪酬，句号，那会很有帮助。因为那基本上就是你所说的，对吧？

